  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.010" end="00:07.520" ttm:agent="v1">Movin' on, never feel the same</p>
      <p begin="00:07.520" end="00:15.440" ttm:agent="v1">Nothin' seems to cover up the pain</p>
      <p begin="00:15.440" end="00:19.550" ttm:agent="v1">Look, uh, do you lo-lo-lo-love me?</p>
      <p begin="00:19.550" end="00:21.050" ttm:agent="v1">I just gotta know</p>
      <p begin="00:20.110" end="00:21.610" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you said it ain't shit</p>
      <p begin="00:21.150" end="00:22.980" ttm:agent="v1">But shit can get ugly</p>
      <p begin="00:22.980" end="00:24.480" ttm:agent="v1">Like you plus me</p>
      <p begin="00:23.930" end="00:26.460" ttm:agent="v1">Me plus you, do you know what I mean?</p>
      <p begin="00:26.460" end="00:27.960" ttm:agent="v1">And even if it don't add up</p>
      <p begin="00:27.650" end="00:30.090" ttm:agent="v1">I can minus the hoes and we'll see where it leads</p>
      <p begin="00:30.090" end="00:32.120" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you just wanna dance with the girls</p>
      <p begin="00:32.120" end="00:33.960" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna give you the world</p>
      <p begin="00:33.960" end="00:35.670" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna call me at 3 a.m. like</p>
      <p begin="00:35.670" end="00:37.650" ttm:agent="v1">Are you with her? 'Cause I heard</p>
      <p begin="00:37.650" end="00:39.360" ttm:agent="v1">You was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="00:39.360" end="00:41.200" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="00:41.200" end="00:42.700" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sophie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="00:42.670" end="00:44.630" ttm:agent="v1">I'm pressed 'cause I know that you're not here with me</p>
      <p begin="00:44.630" end="00:46.500" ttm:agent="v1">Thinking of you, wherever you are</p>
      <p begin="00:46.500" end="00:48.270" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe we just think too much and that's why</p>
      <p begin="00:48.270" end="00:49.770" ttm:agent="v1">We not together</p>
      <p begin="00:49.250" end="00:50.750" ttm:agent="v1">We are together?</p>
      <p begin="00:50.520" end="00:52.020" ttm:agent="v1">Either way, we both get jealous</p>
      <p begin="00:51.800" end="00:53.750" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause it's fuck that dude that you love so much</p>
      <p begin="00:53.750" end="00:56.110" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause fuck that girl, she a dub</p>
      <p begin="00:56.110" end="00:57.610" ttm:agent="v1">I just wish you would understand</p>
      <p begin="00:57.470" end="00:59.210" ttm:agent="v1">But I always seem to fuck it up</p>
      <p begin="00:59.210" end="01:01.860" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I just wanna chill with the girls</p>
      <p begin="01:01.860" end="01:03.360" ttm:agent="v1">I still wanna call you my girl</p>
      <p begin="01:03.280" end="01:04.890" ttm:agent="v1">I know we both toxic as fuck</p>
      <p begin="01:04.890" end="01:07.270" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm drunk, but I promise I love you for real</p>
      <p begin="01:07.270" end="01:09.100" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="01:09.100" end="01:11.030" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="01:11.030" end="01:12.530" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sophie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="01:12.310" end="01:14.020" ttm:agent="v1">Whatever, I wish you could be here with me</p>
      <p begin="01:14.020" end="01:15.880" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause like girl, you so lovely</p>
      <p begin="01:15.880" end="01:17.700" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm hoping that you fuck with me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.700" end="01:19.550" ttm:agent="v1">I got racks and I hope you see the love in me</p>
      <p begin="01:19.550" end="01:21.150" ttm:agent="v1">And not what I'm getting paid like monthly</p>
      <p begin="01:21.150" end="01:22.650" ttm:agent="v1">Alright, so what's good?</p>
      <p begin="01:22.150" end="01:23.650" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, what's up?</p>
      <p begin="01:23.250" end="01:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna fuck, girl, I just wanna love you, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:25.280" end="01:27.120" ttm:agent="v1">And my ex want me, well that's tough, lil' bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:27.120" end="01:28.820" ttm:agent="v1">But I just want you, might flip the switch</p>
      <p begin="01:28.820" end="01:30.730" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm on, girl, you light me up</p>
      <p begin="01:30.730" end="01:32.680" ttm:agent="v1">I could pretend that I really couldn't give a fuck</p>
      <p begin="01:32.680" end="01:34.530" ttm:agent="v1">Shout out Ga$p, he's the reason that I give a fuck</p>
      <p begin="01:34.530" end="01:36.500" ttm:agent="v1">And every time you walk by, girl, you have me struck</p>
      <p begin="01:36.500" end="01:38.120" ttm:agent="v1">Like lighting, girl, it's frightening</p>
      <p begin="01:38.120" end="01:39.930" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm with you, I feel enlightened</p>
      <p begin="01:39.930" end="01:41.980" ttm:agent="v1">When you're gone, I feel like dying</p>
      <p begin="01:41.980" end="01:43.970" ttm:agent="v1">I don't miss you, girl, I'm lyin'</p>
      <p begin="01:43.970" end="01:45.470" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause</p>
      <p begin="01:44.650" end="01:46.590" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna dance with the girls</p>
      <p begin="01:46.590" end="01:48.330" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna give you the world</p>
      <p begin="01:48.330" end="01:50.070" ttm:agent="v1">You just wanna call me at 3 a.m. like</p>
      <p begin="01:50.070" end="01:52.060" ttm:agent="v1">Are you with her? 'Cause I heard</p>
      <p begin="01:52.060" end="01:53.850" ttm:agent="v1">You was with Kendall and Bre</p>
      <p begin="01:53.850" end="01:55.630" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sam and Celine</p>
      <p begin="01:55.630" end="01:57.130" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe it was Sophie, Vanessa</p>
      <p begin="01:57.050" end="01:58.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm pressed 'cause I know that you're not here with me</p>
      <p begin="01:58.840" end="02:02.840" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
